This system module supports Dungeons & Dragons 5th Edition.

`system.md` in this directory is original prose written for open-tabletop-gm
describing procedures of play. It is licensed under the project's
AGPL-3.0-or-later.

No third-party game data is distributed with this repository. The dataset
builders in this directory fetch from the sources below at build time, and
their output under `systems/dnd5e/data/` is untracked by Git and never
published here.

  5e-bits/5e-database — https://github.com/5e-bits/5e-database
    Project code: MIT License.
    Underlying game material: Open Game License v1.0a.
    Used by build_srd.py for spells, equipment, magic items, conditions
    and monsters (2014 SRD).

  foundryvtt/dnd5e — https://github.com/foundryvtt/dnd5e
    Project code: MIT License.
    Game material: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    (CC BY 4.0), derived from the System Reference Document by Wizards of
    the Coast LLC.
    Used by build_srd.py for class features and racial traits (2024 SRD).

If you redistribute a built dataset, you take on the source's obligations:
the OGL v1.0a requires that its full license text accompany any Open Game
Content, and CC BY 4.0 requires attribution to Wizards of the Coast LLC.
This repository triggers neither obligation because it ships no data.

`build_supplemental.py` scrapes dnd5e.wikidot.com on request. That content is
not openly licensed. Its output is untracked, local-only, and must not be
redistributed.

